&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ece3f0faca0685ae80c6c385d1aef5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0410f7fe/uploads/origins/01bc7174-f2cf-453e-975e-a88ceb29baa7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e6f4d4382061bea73d0b446400d923a8 3x"}, "body": "きむちゃんさんこんにちは！ \nいつも素敵なイラストをありがとうございますm(_ _)m \nもしよろしければまた同じうちの子を描いていただけないでしょうか…！ \n参考資料のOCにジャージメイド服を着せていただきたいです。 その他構図などはすべておまかせします🙇‍♂️  \n使用用途として、描いていただいたイラストを印刷所に依頼してグッズを作成してもよろしいでしょうか…？自分用の数点のみ作成します \n印刷所に画像を送ることになるので個人使用の範囲を超えることになるかもと思い記載させていただきました\nご縁がありましたらよろしくお願いいたしますm(_ _)m\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/10XrKMQbXxecFHpzcn5QvgLo_pnhXR8UV/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ETqv6/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3703564, "client_id": 1208881, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/87a74026/uploads/origins/3d862da8-818c-4b16-baa5-f372a0e3acfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bec1782e9ff70b638bce67b4d1336bf5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87a74026/uploads/origins/3d862da8-818c-4b16-baa5-f372a0e3acfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bec1782e9ff70b638bce67b4d1336bf5, https://si.imgix.net/87a74026/uploads/origins/3d862da8-818c-4b16-baa5-f372a0e3acfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7afb2ad3d7fa0831ca20ef47fc0a0ad2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/87a74026/uploads/origins/3d862da8-818c-4b16-baa5-f372a0e3acfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=682d690cea5795ca13f31932ab9d9f7b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/87a74026/uploads/origins/3d862da8-818c-4b16-baa5-f372a0e3acfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=14c8840aab350b3d3a7bb0f5d890434d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87a74026/uploads/origins/3d862da8-818c-4b16-baa5-f372a0e3acfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=14c8840aab350b3d3a7bb0f5d890434d, https://si.imgix.net/87a74026/uploads/origins/3d862da8-818c-4b16-baa5-f372a0e3acfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=87fee78b58cba7392e854430c4c03040 2x, https://si.imgix.net/87a74026/uploads/origins/3d862da8-818c-4b16-baa5-f372a0e3acfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a50d8c718d6b89024f1bdd93bafa7150 3x"}, "body": "hello! i loved the piece you did for me previously and would be so thrilled if you could draw another original character for me!\n\nappearance:\n- his right eye is considerably paler than his left eye, which is grey! \n- beauty mark on the tip of his nose. \n- two eyebrow piercings on the right side of his face, and a lip ring. \n- his face has a lot of scars. the scars include what look like little stitches (or \"X\"-es) at the corners of his lips.\n- hair is black, messy, and covers most of his ear piercings. aside from the detailed/ornate ones he wears on his right ear, he wears two plain silver studs on his lobe on his left ear.\n- wears sunglasses around a lot because his eyes are sensitive! \n- he is also always seen with a plain chain necklace around his neck.\n- i would love if you could add some blue forget-me-not tattoos on his arms! \n\nprofile:\n- his age is unknown, but estimated to be about 24/25. \n- darker skin\n- 190 cm. he has an athletic build.\n- he dresses like a punk. a lot of ripped clothing, tattered/old clothes in general. his body is always too warm/hot and he works as a mechanic, so he likes to keep his clothes loose. \n- he has an easygoing/relaxed expression to his face that can come across as haughty and unapproachable sometimes, but he's actually gentle-hearted. 